  "description": "The Stereo 150 C:62 Race 29 is as rock-solid dependable descending an Alp as it is agile and sure-footed picking a route up a long climb. Newmen Evolution wheels with an upgraded three-pawl freehub work with Sram's 1x12 GX transmission - and a new 52-tooth large sprocket - to get your power to the trail via grippy Maxxis Minion tyres. We fitted powerful Magura MT Thirty hydraulic disc brakes with an oversize front rotor, so you have total control. And the RockShox Lyrik Select fork and Super Deluxe Select+ shock perfectly complement our precise kinematics, for rock-swallowing smoothness that'll have you coming back for more.",
